<title>USA: Telco Systems sets holder rights plan.</title>
<headline>Telco Systems sets holder rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>NORWOOD, Mass 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telco Systems Inc said Thursday its board of directors had approved a shareholder rights plan with a 15-percent threshold.</p>
